      "title": "File:Büyük Çiçekli Manolya 2024.05 (2).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/71/B%C3%BCy%C3%BCk_%C3%87i%C3%A7ekli_Manolya_2024.05_%282%29.jpg",
